Um...

00:37:33.099 --> 00:37:43.920
Chloe, before I left, there was this moment that we, um...

00:37:43.920 --> 00:37:45.920
You mean when I laid one on you?

00:37:45.920 --> 00:37:51.340
Don't worry, Clark. It was the end of the world.

00:37:51.340 --> 00:37:57.059
It's not like I'm expecting us to hook up.

00:37:57.059 --> 00:37:58.059
Um...

00:37:58.059 --> 00:37:59.059
Yeah.

00:37:59.059 --> 00:38:00.059
I mean, me neither.

00:38:00.059 --> 00:38:02.059
Hey, Braddice.

00:38:02.059 --> 00:38:03.059
Hey.

00:38:03.059 --> 00:38:04.059
Oh, bad time?

00:38:04.059 --> 00:38:05.059
No.

00:38:05.059 --> 00:38:08.059
Uh, I was just talking to a friend.

00:38:08.059 --> 00:38:14.719
Uh, I was just talking to a friend.

00:38:14.719 --> 00:38:15.719
Whoa, huh.

00:38:15.719 --> 00:38:17.719
Grove and Big in Kansas, don't they?

00:38:17.719 --> 00:38:18.719
I'm sorry.

00:38:18.719 --> 00:38:20.719
Jimmy Olsen, this is Clark Kent.

00:38:20.719 --> 00:38:27.699
Actually, it's, uh, uh, uh, uh, James, Olson.

00:38:27.699 --> 00:38:31.699
Really? Since when?

00:38:31.699 --> 00:38:34.750
Since...

00:38:34.750 --> 00:38:35.750
Since... Now?

00:38:35.750 --> 00:38:46.289
Now, I should grab some dinner at the vending machine.

00:38:46.289 --> 00:38:49.289
Love to. James.

00:38:49.289 --> 00:38:54.969
Uh, Clark, are you hungry?

00:38:54.969 --> 00:39:00.079
Me, no. I'm okay. You guys, go ahead.

00:39:00.079 --> 00:39:25.760
Get you later, CK.

00:39:25.760 --> 00:39:26.760
How are Lois and Chloe?

00:39:26.760 --> 00:39:28.760
Fine. Both gonna be fine.

00:39:28.760 --> 00:39:30.760
Both gonna be fine.

00:39:30.760 --> 00:39:34.760
Good. Lionel told me his connection to Jorel is gone.

00:39:34.760 --> 00:39:38.760
Long with any influence he had over him.

00:39:38.760 --> 00:39:39.760
Maybe we're all better off.

00:39:39.760 --> 00:39:42.760
We were all better off without Jorel on our lives.

00:39:42.760 --> 00:39:48.000
I took Raya's Crystal to the Fortress for Safekeeping.

00:39:48.000 --> 00:39:53.780
I tried to talk to Jarrell, but he wouldn't...

00:39:53.780 --> 00:39:59.710
Wouldn't answer.

00:39:59.710 --> 00:40:00.710
The Fortress is dead.

00:40:00.710 --> 00:40:08.280
Everything's changing.

00:40:08.280 --> 00:40:09.280
Dad's gone.

00:40:09.280 --> 00:40:12.559
I can't talk to Lex.

00:40:12.559 --> 00:40:20.489
Lana's... I don't know where to go from here.

00:40:20.489 --> 00:40:23.929
I didn't either when I was your age.

00:40:23.929 --> 00:40:26.929
Just follow your heart.

00:40:26.929 --> 00:40:33.030
And you'll always do the right thing.

00:40:33.030 --> 00:40:35.030
Maybe some Kryptonians believe the same thing.

00:40:35.030 --> 00:40:36.030
the same thing.

00:40:36.030 --> 00:40:40.889
Jarrell sacrificed himself trying to save Krypton.

00:40:40.889 --> 00:40:45.289
Raya died saving me.

00:40:45.289 --> 00:40:51.400
Every world needs its heroes, Clark.

00:40:51.400 --> 00:40:55.400
They inspire us to be better than we are.

00:40:55.400 --> 00:41:05.219
You protect us from the darkness that's just around the corner.

